<title>NEW ZEALAND: Westpac cuts NZ variable home rate to 10.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Westpac cuts NZ variable home rate to 10.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Banking Corporation on Friday said it had reduced its New Zealand housing lending rate for Choices Home loans and variable rate housing loans by 0.75 percent to 10.75 percent.</p>
<p>The new rates were effective immediately for new borrowers and from December 16, 1996, for existing borrowers.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
